1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,300
You applied. Then nothing.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,000
HearBack. A job board where silence shows.

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:13,900
A job board, built end to end.
One application, followed until it gets an answer.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,781
Rafi looks for Laravel work.
Each result shows his match.

5
00:00:17,931 --> 00:00:25,116
The match, before he applies.
Skills, pay, workplace, location and experience, line by line. Only he can see it.

6
00:00:25,416 --> 00:00:31,015
A CV and a few honest lines.
Applied here, so it can be followed to the end.

7
00:00:31,315 --> 00:00:36,567
Sent. And it has a timeline.
Every answer from the company will land here.

8
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:40,224
Hannah opens her applicants.

9
00:00:40,624 --> 00:00:43,484
Profile, CV and application in one place.

10
00:00:43,884 --> 00:00:49,351
Rafi opens his application. It is already there.

11
00:00:49,751 --> 00:00:53,773
Each stage, as it happens.

12
00:00:54,173 --> 00:00:57,636
Ten minutes to undo it, before he is told.

13
00:00:58,086 --> 00:01:01,233
He heard back.

14
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:06,949
Answering people is public.
Companies that answer their applicants carry this mark.

15
00:01:07,349 --> 00:01:13,900
Candidates review the hiring.
After an interview, a decision, or 30 days of silence. The company can answer in public.

16
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:20,938
A CV, drawn from the profile.
Seven templates and a live preview. No design tool needed.

17
00:01:21,238 --> 00:01:29,900
Any colour that reads on white.
Up to ten saved CVs, aimed at a job, as PDF, Word or a web page.

18
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:37,233
How each posting is doing.
Views, applications, how far people got, and how quickly the team answers.

19
00:01:37,833 --> 00:01:45,233
A new employer is read first.
Their postings wait for a moderator before the public sees them.

20
00:01:45,833 --> 00:01:50,567
Light and dark, from the same tokens.

21
00:01:50,967 --> 00:01:59,333
Nothing just disappears.
1,590+ Pest tests. 19 policies. Ten minutes to undo a decision. 9 architecture decisions written down.

22
00:01:59,733 --> 00:02:07,033
HearBack. github.com/Md-Foisal/job-board
Designed and built by Md. Foisal. A portfolio project, shown with demo data.
